WEBVTT

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.010
This morning there was a note in your bottle to discontinue the service.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.970
I thought I'd drop by and see what it was all about.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.600
Is anything wrong?

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:34.210
Oh, it's just that Mr. Benny has to go to New York, and I'm going with him.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:40.720
So we're discontinuing the milk, shutting off the gas, the water, the lice, the telephone, and laying off the gardener.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.460
Well, you're going to be gone.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:44.880
Ten days.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.890
Had trouble for ten days?

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:53.470
Anything over two weeks, we rent the house.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.700
Well, as long as I'm here, I guess we might as well settle up the bill, huh?

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.340
That's $1.82.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.640
Okay, I'll have Mr. Ben to make a check for you.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.200
No, no, no, no. That's what I owe him.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:09.510
Where he gets all those extra deposit bottles, I'll never know.

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:15.350
Okay, thanks.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:16.500
So long, Rochester.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:18.700
So long now. Bye.

